# Build artefacts, matched at any depth: gpark's own tree and any nested project
# in this workspace (e.g. riscgp/) have their own _build/deps directories, and a
# top-level-only pattern silently leaves the nested ones tracked.
**/_build/
**/deps/
**/doc/
**/cover/
**/.elixir_ls/
**/node_modules/
elixir/_build/
elixir/deps/

*.ez
*.cubin
*.sass
*.fatbin
remote/_out/
python/src/*.so
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
dist/
build/
*.egg-info/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.DS_Store
corpus/golden/.ptxas/
